* **Amplifier:** Roland Cube 20GX (You must remember this amp has 3 different channels like JC CLEAN, LEAD (six different types), and SOLO, multiple amp models like 'Acoustic Sim', 'OVERDRIVE', 'DISTORTION', 'METAL', 'METAL STACK', 'EXTREME' etc., and built-in effects like Chorus, Delay, and Reverb. Controls of this amp are [POWER switch
